请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-19-photo-album-004

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
搞个回忆相册,文字叠背景图上,显示一行带数字,点一下跳app,读日历,显示已连接

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "搞个回忆相册,文字叠背景图上,显示一行带数字,点一下跳app,读日历,显示已连接",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings.MainAbility",
        "uri": "bluetooth_entry"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "calendar": {
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "今日可用于回忆相册的日历事件列表，卡片用列表数量生成回忆数量。",
          "sampleValue": [
            {
              "entityName": "calendar",
              "entityId": "memory-001",
              "title": "晨间散步",
              "dtStart": "08:30",
              "dtEnd": "09:00"
            },
            {
              "entityName": "calendar",
              "entityId": "memory-002",
              "title": "午后咖啡",
              "dtStart": "14:00",
              "dtEnd": "14:30"
            },
            {
              "entityName": "calendar",
              "entityId": "memory-003",
              "title": "晚间相册整理",
              "dtStart": "20:00",
              "dtEnd": "20:30"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_schedule2.png",
      "description": "日程图标素材，适合承载日历事件、当下日程和回忆相册的时间线视觉锚点。"
    }
  ]
}

